WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.298
"Do Not Eat Pawpaws"

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:10.718
The pawpaw
is the largest fruit

00:00:10.718 --> 00:00:11.920
native to North America,

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.240
weighing up
to two pounds (1 kg).

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.920
Look at these beauties!

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:18.400
You can just
scoop it right out.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.720
Pawpaws taste like
a mixture of bananas,

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:22.240
mangos, and pineapples.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.920
They're like a tropical
banana-mango custard,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.640
but found in
temperate forests

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.560
across the eastern
United States,

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.200
nourishing humankind
for thousands of years

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.560
and now complete with
their own pawpaw festivals.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:38.960
Papayas are
sometimes called pawpaws,

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.800
but they're
completely different fruits.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.240
The real pawpaw is
also known as the dog banana,

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.800
false-banana,
Indian banana,

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.120
prairie banana,
poor man's banana,

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:52.720
Ozark banana,
Banango (I like that one),

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.920
Indiana banana
(has a nice ring to it, too),

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:58.160
and the Kentucky banana.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.920
Pawpaws are my
favorite fruit,

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:03.200
or, should I say,
were my favorite fruit.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.760
One of the reasons
that I moved to rural Virginia

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.520
was because the property

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:10.320
had a whole grove
of pawpaw trees.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:13.040
I was going to be
set for life.

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:16.000
That is, until I ate
a few too many

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.280
on the first harvest,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.640
became quite ill,
and actually looked them up.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:22.160
Pro tip: in the future,

00:01:22.160 --> 00:01:26.480
look to see if a food is toxic
before you eat lots of it.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.480
Little did I know,
the pawpaw belonged

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:30.880
to an infamous
family of fruits

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.800
that contain three different
types of neurotoxins.

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.960
I had actually done
a video, years ago,

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:38.960
warning people
not to eat soursop,

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.800
also known as graviola,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:44.320
but didn't realize
pawpaws were related.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:49.760
The family includes
soursop, guanabana, sweetsop,

00:01:49.760 --> 00:01:52.400
sugar apple, cherimoya,
and custard-apple,

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.520
which are all linked to
a neurodegenerative disease

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:58.800
called progressive
supranuclear palsy,

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.120
which is like a
treatment-resistant Parkinson's,

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:04.400
with hallucinations,
widespread brain atrophy,

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.080
and dementia.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.520
And consumption
of these fruits

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:09.920
is associated with
about 20 times the odds

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:12.960
of having this kind of
atypical Parkinson's syndrome.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:15.360
Expose rats to even
a fraction of the dose

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.560
the people were exposed to,

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.960
and they develop the same
kind of brain lesions

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:21.760
you see on autopsy
in human victims.

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:25.280
And, in several patients who
stopped consuming these fruits,

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:27.520
the progression
of their condition ceased,

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.720
and, in one patient,
the symptoms even disappeared

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.120
after a change in diet.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:35.840
There is an urgent need
to raise public awareness

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.040
about the neurotoxicity
of this family of fruits,

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.200
which are often,
ironically, praised

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.560
for their taste
and medicinal values.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.960
In fact, you can find
dietary supplements

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.000
containing these plants,

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.200
promoted for their
purported anticancer effects.

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:55.760
And a soursop extract
can inhibit cancer cell growth

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:58.640
in a petri dish,
but only at concentrations

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:02.000
much higher than the amount
that kills off brain cells.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.640
Even a low
cumulative consumption

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:07.680
may worsen disease severity
and cognitive deficits

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:10.640
in degenerative
Parkinson's type disease,

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:13.280
as in 0.2 fruit-years.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:16.320
So, that's just one-fifth
of a fruit a day for a year,

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.480
or a single fruit a month
for six years,

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:21.520
or just one fruit a year
throughout your entire life.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:23.280
The bottom line
is that these fruit

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.880
could contribute
to the development

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.760
of degenerative
parkinsonism in humans,

00:03:27.760 --> 00:03:29.280
and so, as a precaution,

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.000
more restrictive public health
preventive recommendations

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.120
should be made
regarding their consumption.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:38.480
So, okay, consumption
of these tropical fruits

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.320
potentially constitutes
a serious public health problem,

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.640
but what about pawpaws?

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.200
Here's the amount
of the primary neurotoxin

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.720
in soursop, aka graviola.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:54.240
Pawpaws have ten times more.

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:57.360
So, why aren't
pawpaw eaters getting sick?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.760
Well, it's only ripe
for a few weeks a year,

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.640
so, unlike the tropical fruit
that can be eaten year-round,

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:05.440
people may not have
a lot of exposure to them.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:09.360
Fresh pawpaws aren't really
even sold commercially, either,

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:11.520
since they bruise so easily,

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.240
but now the fruit's
available in any season,

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:16.640
sold as frozen pulp or jam,

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:18.560
and there are
supplements out there too.

00:04:18.560 --> 00:04:20.000
Not to mention,
if you're like me,

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.320
trees in your backyard.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.600
When the U.S. Food and Drug
Administration was asked about them,

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:28.560
they noted that pawpaw
has a long history of food use,

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:32.800
and it didn't have any evidence
that the fruit was unsafe to eat.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.560
You'll hear things like this:

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.000
"Currently,
there have been no reports

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:37.520
of neurogenerative diseases

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:40.240
linked to the consumption
of the pawpaw fruit,"

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:43.200
until, of course, there are.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:46.480
"Progressive supranuclear
palsy and pawpaw."

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:48.640
Poor guy had trouble
speaking and walking

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:52.480
as his brain
was atrophying in his skull.

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:55.200
Tragically he actually died
before they figured it out,

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.160
but his wife disclosed
that they owned pawpaw trees,

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.480
and he had been
eating dozens a year.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.240
And when researchers
started looking,

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.160
they indeed seemed
to find a link between

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:06.160
this neurodegenerative disease

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.520
and pawpaw consumption
in the United States.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:13.931
So, alas,
no more pawpaws for me.

